Package: MoPAIR
Type: Package
Title: Module-Level Paired-Path Association Inference for Related Mediators
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(person("Xinghao", "Yu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "yuxinghao1994@suda.edu.cn"),
    person("MoPAIR Development Team", role = "aut"))
Description: Constructs outcome-free molecular modules, evaluates member-aligned
    exposure and outcome path evidence, combines uncorrected divide-aggregate
    composite-null test statistics using the aggregated Cauchy association test,
    and applies module-level Benjamini-Hochberg adjustment. Supports continuous,
    binary, and right-censored survival outcomes, with efficient logistic score
    tests and Cox proportional hazards models. Includes a fixed-module
    multiple-exposure interface and synthetic examples.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: graphics, stats, survival, utils
Suggests: DACT, covr
Remotes: zhonghualiu/DACT
URL: https://github.com/biostatYu/MoPAIR
BugReports: https://github.com/biostatYu/MoPAIR/issues
